  m_text: 'I ESCAPED, but I will not forget what those people did to me. I will come
    back for you my brothers. I will go get some blood for me and all of you and
    I will return to free you all.


    These powers they gave me will be the very
    thing that ends them, my escape will be the start of something greater vampires
    will no more be slaves to humans.


    This letter is a war cry so if you are
    reading this it means I have sent it in and I am coming so tell everyone inside
    to be ready 25th December you must cause a riot.


    While that happens I will
    attack from the outside with my team we will get them from both sides they will
    not be able to cope.'
